{#
  BeMart storefront Block widget — footer.

  PORT of EC-CUBE 4.3 default-theme `Block/footer.twig`
  (src/Eccube/Resource/template/default/Block/footer.twig).

  EC-CUBE composes the storefront frame's FOOTER region from operator-
  configurable Block widgets (dtb_block / dtb_block_position). ALPS does
  not model Block — it is pure presentation — so the honest reference is
  EC-CUBE's own default-theme Block template. This file keeps EC-CUBE's
  markup skeleton and `ec-*` class names verbatim.

  EC-CUBE-ism rebinding (see var/templates/README.md):
   - `{{ 'front.block.footer.*'|trans }}` -> the Japanese literal the key
     resolves to in messages.ja.yaml (about_us / privacy_policy /
     act_on_specified_commercial_transactions / inquiry).
   - `url('help_about'|'help_privacy'|'help_tradelaw'|'contact'|'homepage')`
     -> BeMartTwigExtension `url()`.
   - `BaseInfo.shop_name` -> the frame's `shop_name` variable, defaulting
     to `BeMart` (the storefront frame carries no BaseInfo entity).

  This widget is PURELY STATIC — it needs no domain data, only the shop
  name already available to the frame. It is therefore portable directly.
#}
<div class="ec-footerRole">
    <div class="ec-footerRole__inner">
        <ul class="ec-footerNavi">
            <li class="ec-footerNavi__link">
                <a href="{{ url('help_about') }}">当サイトについて</a>
            </li>
            <li class="ec-footerNavi__link">
                <a href="{{ url('help_privacy') }}">プライバシーポリシー</a>
            </li>
            <li class="ec-footerNavi__link">
                <a href="{{ url('help_tradelaw') }}">特定商取引法に基づく表記</a>
            </li>
            <li class="ec-footerNavi__link">
                <a href="{{ url('contact') }}">お問い合わせ</a>
            </li>
        </ul>
        <div class="ec-footerTitle">
            <div class="ec-footerTitle__logo">
                <a href="{{ url('homepage') }}">{{ shop_name|default('BeMart') }}</a>
            </div>
            <div class="ec-footerTitle__copyright">copyright (c) {{ shop_name|default('BeMart') }} all rights reserved.</div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
